            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI guess adding the third option of something like \"No, (K)eep edits\" might be a good idea. And making `synchronize()` return `true` if sync was done and `false` (with or without keeping edits) otherwise. I'll take a look.",
